al of 83,254 probable † and 139,366 confirmed § dengue cases were reported\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Probable cases are defined as a febrile illness lasting ≤7 days in a person who resides in or has visited areas with dengue virus transmission\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"the 222,620 cases in 2023 were approximately 10 times the average number during the same period during the previous 5 years (21,841 cases)\"}, {\"loc\": \"figure 1\", \"q\": \"Population = 34 million.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}